AI Daily Digest V2

This repository is a maintained derivative of AI Daily Digest by AllenX-Li:
https://github.com/AllenX-Li/ai-daily-digest

V2 maintenance and integration repository:
https://github.com/AlexJJ009/ai-daily-digest-v2

The original project is represented by the upstream Git history and remains
available under the MIT License. V2 changes add a typed digest contract,
OpenAI-compatible providers, strict output validation, and a configurable
source registry. See README.md for the branch and synchronization policy.
